            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vxEah",
              "name": "Idea",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Required: nothing else opens until it is done. Models: Parakeet v3 is the live model, so it is a required line, not a choice; below it the final-pass engine is chosen, with no default. Each model says where it comes from: «есть», «есть · из Amanu» (reused only on an exact file match: name, size and checksum) or «↓ size» (the app downloads its own copy). Then the calls folder (visible, default ~/Recordings/Audelin; settings and logs stay in ~/.audelin) and the permissions: microphone, call audio, and Calendar, optional and marked v3, which names a call after the event it overlaps. Continue waits for an engine choice and for every model to be on disk: nothing records while a model downloads.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wryTz",
              "name": "Open",
              "fill": "#B4540A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Whether Amanu's q5_0 file is the exact file the Whisper engine expects is checked at runtime; «из Amanu» here assumes it is.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
