          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "MqQK7",
              "name": "Number",
              "fill": "#0E9F92",
              "content": "GLASS LEDGER · SCREEN 3",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": 1.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aqutg",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "#111318",
              "content": "Live panel states",
              "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
              "fontSize": 38,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": -1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Lqmlc",
              "name": "Idea",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The Glass Ledger panel through a call. Speakers are words in the gutter: «я» is the mic track in teal, «они» the call track in amber. Start and stop sit in the header. With live text switched off the panel says the call is only recorded and offers to switch it on; switched off mid-call, the text so far stays above the notice. Unconfirmed text is dim and is replaced in place when confirmed text arrives; live text is as messy as the spike's Parakeet output (ОКР, слог, repeats at chunk edges). Each finished selection is held exactly as selected and added to the holds under the log: new lines below, a phrase settling differently and a click in the text never change a hold, and × lets one go. ⌃⌥⌘E sends the selection to a bb thread; the card reports each step, and the explanation comes back from the thread's output, with «bb · тред ↗» for follow-up. Switching live text on mid-call fills in the earlier minutes, marked «дописано позже».",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "u7Uofk",
              "name": "Open",
              "fill": "#B4540A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Decided (agents, owner delegated, 2026-10-21; mvp.md): late-filled text is marked «дописано позже» and drawn dimmer. Decided (owner, 2026-10-22): each selection adds a hold, the selection fades from the log over 0.3 s once held, the log does not mark held text, and only × lets a hold go. Still proposed: each hold a pinned quote row under the log; no hotkey for start/stop; the 4 s steps follow the default chunk size; «они» covers everyone on the call until remote speakers get names (Later in mvp.md). RACI was never spoken in the spike, so its spelling here is a guess.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
