            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Gcja6",
              "name": "Idea",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A ledger of calls, newest first: date, title, duration, then the audio's fate (kept 7 days; a pinned call keeps it; after cleanup the transcript stays). Each call is a folder named yyyy.MM.dd-HHmm <title>; the title starts as the call app's name («Zoom») and from v3 is the overlapping calendar event's name. Click a title to rename inline, the prefix stays fixed; a Finder rename works too, and a folder without the prefix still lists under its date from meta.json. Two calls in the same minute with the same title: the second gets « 2». Удалить shows on hover and asks to confirm.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "awZx8",
              "name": "Open",
              "fill": "#B4540A",
