              "content": "Opened from Стоп or the calls list. The header shows the title (click to rename inline; the yyyy.MM.dd-HHmm prefix stays fixed), the call's folder in the visible ~/Recordings/Audelin and its five files: meta.json, audio.m4a, raw.md, final.md, summary.md. Until the final pass ends, the live text is shown and labelled; a failed pass names its cause and links to the log. The app writes summary.md itself from the bb thread's output and shows it above the transcript, with «bb · тред ↗» for follow-up.",
