              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Errors appear inside the panel, under the header, and never hide the text already captured. One missing track: recording goes on with the other, the banner names the missing side and links to the permission, and the gutter marks the gap. Disk full: recording stops, everything before the stop is kept, the banner says when it stopped, and Начать is disabled so a new call cannot start into the same error.",
